#: ../../source/docs/git-fork.rst:5 0e86a64cbe0542e281ba929d20bf4c96
msgid "Forking the repository"
msgstr "Fork 仓库"

#: ../../source/docs/git-fork.rst:10 22af0f31ddcd444d90a4ba9f688e79cf
msgid ""
"If you are working towards :ref:`submitting code back to the main ArduPilot "
"repo <submitting-patches-back-to-master>` you will want to create your own "
"personal copy of the ArduPilot repository on the GitHub servers.  This is "
"called \"forking\" the repo."
msgstr ""
"如果您打算 :ref:`向主 ArduPilot 仓库提交代码 <submitting-patches-back-to-master>`，需要在 "
"GitHub 服务器上创建 ArduPilot 仓库的个人副本，这称为「Fork」仓库。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-fork.rst:12 5aa17b9e6e3e49709b9ae66b465a4158
msgid ""
"When you fork the ArduPilot repo, the code's history of changes is preserved"
" and a relationship between the fork and the original is maintained which "
"allows the fork to be updated from the original and for changes to be "
"submitted back to the original."
msgstr ""
"Fork ArduPilot 仓库时，代码的变更历史将被保留，fork 与原始仓库之间的关联也得以维持，从而允许从原始仓库更新 "
"fork，也可以将更改提交回原始仓库。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-fork.rst:14 437ce81fdded416cb6411a7ea9528092
msgid ""
"`sign up for a free user account with Github <https://github.com/join>`__"
msgstr "`注册 GitHub 免费用户账号 <https://github.com/join>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/git-fork.rst:15 6d7c00403fe34971982c4ff1f1f342a7
msgid ""
"open a web browser and go to `github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__"
msgstr ""
"打开浏览器，访问 `github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/git-fork.rst:16 dca1b4f75e9240f18cc37478ed08a43d
msgid ""
"Click the \"Fork\" button on the upper right corner and follow the "
"instructions"
msgstr "点击右上角的「Fork」按钮，然后按照提示操作"

#: ../../source/docs/git-fork.rst:20 ab40cedc48014ea7bc22b69bd8174421
msgid ""
"When your are finished there will be a new repository within your account: "
"``//github.com/your-github-userid/ardupilot``"
msgstr "完成后，您的账号下将出现一个新仓库：``//github.com/your-github-userid/ardupilot``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-fork.rst:22 36ab08342f194774b4657dbfaf9d92d0
msgid ""
"This forked repository is what you will :ref:`clone <git-clone>` and work on"
" locally when making changes to the code."
msgstr "这个 fork 的仓库就是您在修改代码时 :ref:`克隆 <git-clone>` 并在本地进行操作的目标。"
